Russian diminutive noun pairs

ru_diminutives.tsv is adapted from entries by contributors to English
Wiktionary and Russian Wiktionary. Each row contains a diminutive lemma
and its base noun. Word definitions, examples and translations are omitted.
The table is provided under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0).

License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Source entries and contributor histories:
https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/<word>#Russian
https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/<word>

Kaikki.org extracted the dictionaries with Wiktextract. This adaptation
uses the English Wiktionary dump of 2026-10-01 and the Russian Wiktionary
dump of 2026-11-01. It retains lowercase Russian common nouns when all
listed senses agree on the same diminutive relation. It removes stress
marks and includes three additional hand-reviewed mail terms listed in
the extraction script. These terms are subject to the same homograph
checks as the dictionary entries.

Source indexes:
https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Russian/
https://kaikki.org/ruwiktionary/
Wiktextract: https://github.com/tatuylonen/wiktextract

To regenerate from the repository root using Python 3.11 or newer:

curl -fLO https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Russian/kaikki.org-dictionary-Russian.jsonl
curl -fLO https://kaikki.org/dictionary/downloads/ru/ru-extract.jsonl.gz
gzip -dc ru-extract.jsonl.gz > ru-extract.jsonl
python3 scripts/extract_ru_diminutives.py kaikki.org-dictionary-Russian.jsonl ru-extract.jsonl backend/src/mail_search/application/ru_diminutives.tsv

Kaikki updates these URLs periodically. SHA-256 of the inputs used here:
9078947aa21ed33ccfe9ada814fa70605c282a26bc0b7d60e388865da17984b7  kaikki.org-dictionary-Russian.jsonl
fdcb978c76b660e0e43977bbf7487c812e6d42e965b0a73e3f5b4ba6981174c4  ru-extract.jsonl.gz
